		(property "Description" "Espressif ESP32-DevKitC V4 with ESP32-WROOM-32E, 2 x 19 headers. Pins 1-19 = J2-1..19, pins 20-38 = J3-1..19 (Espressif user guide header table). 5V pin = EXT_5V (BAT760 from USB VBUS on the board); 3V3 = AMS1117 output, about 1 A. Flash pins IO6-IO11 marked no-connect."
